    en: "Bahia Center is a remarkable feature of the geography and culture of Algeria. The Bahia Center is a prominent high-rise complex in Oran offering modern residential and commercial spaces. The four identical towers dominate the modern skyline of the city. 31 floors per tower. 111 meters tall. Four identical towers. This landmark is part of the cultural heritage of Algeria, reflecting Berber, Arab and Mediterranean influences. Like many notable places in Algeria, it combines Berber heritage with Mediterranean and Saharan influences. Thus, this place contributes to the diverse profile of Algeria."
